 "collaborationCommerciale": false,
 "contenu": {
  "_type": "localeRichText",
  "en": [
   {
    "_key": "eq0dg6rieqxg",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "o21qu5a38pvb",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Our winemakers are increasingly committed to the planet. But between organic, HVE, biodynamics and VDC, it is easy to get lost. This guide, written with "
     },
     {
      "_key": "7hh4mwj4zhsp",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "o4dunzksn6m2"
      ],
      "text": "our partner communications agency"
     },
     {
      "_key": "dsw6zhro2hnu",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": ", decodes the labels to help you choose your next cuvée with full knowledge."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [
     {
      "_key": "o4dunzksn6m2",
      "_type": "link",
      "href": "https://www.detectezmoi.com/"
     }
    ],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "v75bjc2c6zh9",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "btg2vtwkwz85",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Quick comparison: what does each label guarantee?"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "2hsbtsqa2h21",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "k4ycnlzug7he",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "To understand a label at a glance"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "tableaulabelsen",
    "_type": "tableauLabels",
    "note": "Labels table"
   },
   {
    "_key": "hgezb2dk27k4",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "502oprcqjeps",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "What is the HVE label? (Level 3 in detail)🌳"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "c9yvbkaim0yf",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "ypmvtmv7m80a",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "The "
     },
     {
      "_key": "azmqucoolap8",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "p5n8q2hqh2lo"
      ],
      "text": "High Environmental Value (HVE)"
     },
     {
      "_key": "uns6qmp6ibor",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " label is a state certification. On bottles, you will only find "
     },
     {
      "_key": "il9nb6e80top",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "Level 3"
     },
     {
      "_key": "cb60q023a3ul",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": ", the only level that guarantees real results with a logo."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [
     {
      "_key": "p5n8q2hqh2lo",
      "_type": "link",
      "href": "https://hve-asso.com/la-hve/"
     }
    ],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "87oylordl4g3",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "063f1wewmtv5",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "HVE 3 sets performance requirements on "
     },
     {
      "_key": "7skollsaifk6",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "4 technical pillars"
     },
     {
      "_key": "fw8u3k365hgm",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": ":"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "cz57oqto36wq",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "vh459thwsi2c",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "Irrigation management:"
     },
     {
      "_key": "mjsf3z0yvfwo",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " this pillar concerns the water supplied to crops. In Champagne, the appellation rules ban irrigating the vines, so it is met by default."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "je34108yn6wc",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "6hq43i2bcx4l",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "Plant protection strategy:"
     },
     {
      "_key": "6imm0telhx9p",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " the crucial point. Treatments are not applied out of habit: each one is reasoned and recorded, according to disease pressure (weather, observations in the vineyard). The most hazardous products, classed CMR 1, have been banned since 2023."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "wt2f5kyhi1so",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "hzvb82fm3rmc",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "Biodiversity:"
     },
     {
      "_key": "wd6lxp919l8p",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " the winemaker must show that the plots are refuges for wildlife (hedges, low walls, beneficial insects)."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "dtypx7b8qgsh",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "3grte4bosc3w",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "Fertilisation management:"
     },
     {
      "_key": "voh6z27cfs2y",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " fertiliser inputs are limited to protect soils and groundwater."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "0mnbvb42fpp5",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "zmabn9gurmw9",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Unlike organic farming, chemical products are not completely banned, but their use must be "
     },
     {
      "_key": "2bzqdtmj5l1c",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "strictly limited and controlled"
     },
     {
      "_key": "vhtsvjjwzpfi",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": ". It is now one of the most widespread labels in Champagne."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "crc1f0274hql",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "jnn0j1q0bnah",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Terra Vitis: why this label?⭐"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "ci5nhjbg9bvq",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "lg2o0ihf18h7",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "The "
     },
     {
      "_key": "dun4r0h30lt0",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "dcguggi9440c"
      ],
      "text": "Terra Vitis"
     },
     {
      "_key": "5pbq8vapdyzu",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "vcla96iw4v6z"
      ],
      "text": " "
     },
     {
      "_key": "zejj7h0s9h2n",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "label is specific to the wine world."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [
     {
      "_key": "dcguggi9440c",
      "_type": "link",
      "href": "https://terravitis.com/"
     },
     {
      "_key": "vcla96iw4v6z",
      "_type": "link",
      "href": "https://terravitis.com/"
     }
    ],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "47oj4l19d1g2",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "zw8gmxlmm6lb",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Traceability: every action of the winemaker is recorded. If a synthetic treatment is used, the winemaker must be able to justify it."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "xjdlc2mq3rmm",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "t9vpuk7nq6rw",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "The difference: a « farmer's common sense » commitment that always favours natural solutions without ruling out action in a major crisis (such as mildew, particularly virulent in our latitudes)."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "pyrnz1h5rk1u",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "osp5m3p9knfy",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Sustainable Viticulture in Champagne (VDC)💧"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "atnupuld7xgk",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "5dix6gmag9eh",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "The "
     },
     {
      "_key": "gjoprt1vsd3n",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "675dpevsb9iw"
      ],
      "text": "Sustainable Viticulture in Champagne"
     },
     {
      "_key": "3yywogj40tzj",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " certification is specific to the Champagne appellation."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [
     {
      "_key": "675dpevsb9iw",
      "_type": "link",
      "href": "https://www.champagne.fr/fr/les-engagements-dans-le-champagne"
     }
    ],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "mweoyukhdzpg",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "t5zdz8n4mkvo",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "It was set up by the Champagne wine industry to encourage sustainable practices in the vineyards."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "e5ig2ho6ajn0",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "oorwz4igzben",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "It covers several issues:"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "xq9xaj8vwu1q",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "yregx6x505ab",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "soil preservation"
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "0ujufig2og1m",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "mcyiv5wv1z8k",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "water management"
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "mah9i05edee2",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "vikwonk6a1c9",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "reduced inputs"
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "6lm920ey2h13",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "qbrzdexiuel8",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "biodiversity"
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "9vrdxylckm3r",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "muk5zei3317e",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "a lower carbon footprint"
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "77gvi4u6mdhr",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "8d5t1cslgwg7",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Today, a large part of the Champagne vineyard is committed to this approach."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "g1yofe1nyjx6",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "hrtq8j0mj0mf",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "The Organic Farming label (AB)🌿"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "4bra40juvf3x",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "wkvt2rcrfo9f",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "The "
     },
     {
      "_key": "hkrv61yics13",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "ll7qiglhg3fa"
      ],
      "text": "Organic Farming"
     },
     {
      "_key": "qt0un50ds7xk",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " label is probably the best known. It guarantees that vines are grown "
     },
     {
      "_key": "hsokb5v8nqb7",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "without synthetic chemical pesticides or herbicides"
     },
     {
      "_key": "oz6e4jdjspq3",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [
     {
      "_key": "ll7qiglhg3fa",
      "_type": "link",
      "href": "https://www.agencebio.org/"
     }
    ],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "5bse1tx2vya2",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "vx3c1p5j18tf",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Organic winemakers mainly use:"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "c8659uhn0j2v",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "fpjhxze72b7v",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "natural products"
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "j9f295r30hf2",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "a06i7fy86bz0",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "copper and sulphur to protect the vine"
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "cc1fo3qwqdo6",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "ghzikjfppf5x",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "mechanical methods to manage weeds"
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "vn0x9oomqvng",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "4j2rzd01f9tt",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "In Champagne, organic winegrowing takes a lot of commitment because the climate is "
     },
     {
      "_key": "k8gwj8846qld",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "damp"
     },
     {
      "_key": "ea32rweqtyy5",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": ", which encourages vine diseases. But more and more estates are taking the step."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "ggpx6gm6ntr3",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "ziy3j66x64ys",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Biodynamics (Demeter / Biodyvin): the ultimate step… and a slightly wild one! 🌙"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "lfgyuk1w5kul",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "5l9yh4fc0gmt",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Biodynamics takes winegrowing "
     },
     {
      "_key": "ohpmen1px5jx",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "well beyond organic"
     },
     {
      "_key": "ekl4warrtytn",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": ", whose rules it keeps: no synthetic chemicals, but copper and sulphur are still allowed, in even smaller amounts. It strengthens the vine with preparations made from plants, cow manure or compost, following the cycles of nature. The lunar calendar is often followed, but it is not compulsory. The aim is to make the vine self-sufficient, alive and fully balanced."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "6241u32bm47o",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "bvlm8mmtosy2",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "k8gtyou30bcz"
      ],
      "text": "Biodyvin"
     },
     {
      "_key": "loqgod6umt7l",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": " and "
     },
     {
      "_key": "jd64p0vnd9ds",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "g4g63o6niydm"
      ],
      "text": "Demeter"
     },
     {
      "_key": "502xaruyz8bd",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": " are two biodynamic certifications"
     },
     {
      "_key": "4ripzx1kyibr",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " that may appear on bottles. Demeter is an international label, open to all farm produce; Biodyvin is reserved for winegrowers, and admission also involves tasting the wines. Both require the estate to be certified organic first."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [
     {
      "_key": "k8gtyou30bcz",
      "_type": "link",
      "href": "https://www.biodyvin.com/"
     },
     {
      "_key": "g4g63o6niydm",
      "_type": "link",
      "href": "https://www.demeter.fr/"
     }
    ],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "jf4mh6gnwn7g",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "sdk7p7enq13h",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Labels don't tell the whole story"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "f8hheeywgpvz",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "9pajlufe4ivg",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "It is important to remember that a label does not say everything about a winemaker's work."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "5f6ou3ldwv4t",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "ajbfxn81e2aw",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "Some estates work in a very nature-friendly way without seeking certification"
     },
     {
      "_key": "mmtvf7ob9t1s",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": ", often for administrative or financial reasons."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "b4wdzdlpid99",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "hn7pto33oazh",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Conversely, a label remains a frame of reference, but the winemaker's philosophy and approach to the vine remain essential."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "ormep24gubad",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "wqx0nc0louli",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "An increasingly committed Champagne"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "7cwgcwj4p0uc",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "2kl27p182he4",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "In recent years, Champagne has strongly committed to an environmental transition."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "rnufxaf2u4x0",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "9lh6a9ytmgp7",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "The industry's goal is clear: "
     },
     {
      "_key": "sz9wkh5mf26h",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "to develop ever more sustainable winegrowing"
     },
     {
      "_key": "f0xekwov4az0",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": ", able to preserve soils, landscapes and the quality of the wines."
     }
