    "note": "Tableau des labels"
   },
   {
    "_key": "f6d6c7dec255",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "2283c0d36362",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "C’est quoi le label HVE ? (Le niveau 3 en détail)🌳"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "fb62094b5706",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "74eae89ccac2",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Le label "
     },
     {
      "_key": "ef4ba64d2eba",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong",
       "8893e3e4b2f4"
      ],
      "text": "Haute Valeur Environnementale (HVE)"
     },
     {
      "_key": "315d7a173416",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " est une certification d’État. Sur vos bouteilles, vous ne trouverez que le "
     },
     {
      "_key": "2369ec6f34a7",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "Niveau 3"
     },
     {
      "_key": "bc510fe2bb2d",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": ", le seul stade qui garantit des résultats réels avec un logo."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [
     {
      "_key": "8893e3e4b2f4",
      "_type": "link",
      "href": "https://hve-asso.com/la-hve/"
     }
    ],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "d649682b8fc3",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "acaeaa0a1677",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Le HVE 3 impose des performances sur "
     },
     {
      "_key": "ab43dbc67f23",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "4 piliers techniques"
     },
     {
      "_key": "e2b2d0e33a04",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " :"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "c066053eb639",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "w5by8dbnsmhr",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "La gestion de l’irrigation :"
     },
     {
      "_key": "hrlsbbld9gqj",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " ce pilier porte sur l’eau apportée aux cultures. En Champagne, le cahier des charges de l’appellation interdit d’irriguer la vigne : il est donc respecté d’office."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "42989d619f12",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "rlx3fufm0967",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "La stratégie phytosanitaire"
     },
     {
      "_key": "uxh847f7jhy2",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " : c’est le point crucial. On ne traite pas par habitude : chaque traitement est raisonné et noté, selon la pression des maladies (météo, observations à la vigne). Les produits les plus dangereux, classés CMR 1, sont interdits depuis 2023."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "297877d119d2",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "76a447ff0fb5",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "La Biodiversité :"
     },
     {
      "_key": "f359d2b6c94f",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " Le vigneron doit prouver que ses parcelles sont des refuges de vie (entretien des haies, murets, présence d’insectes auxiliaires)."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "8a673b1ad24e",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "8321c68e4aaa",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "La Gestion de la Fertilisation :"
     },
     {
      "_key": "e28130a49f7a",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " On limite les apports en engrais pour protéger les sols et les nappes phréatiques."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "147c0804164c",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "34c4e82c237c",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Contrairement au bio, les produits chimiques ne sont pas totalement interdits, mais leur utilisation doit être "
     },
     {
      "_key": "ce0a6a1c5bdc",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "fortement limitée et encadrée"
     },
     {
      "_key": "75bf272740b5",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": ". C’est aujourd’hui l’un des labels les plus répandus en Champagne."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
