    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "ce93c81129f3",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Le label Agriculture Biologique (AB)🌿"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "7bfb77492d98",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "1249bda1c972",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Le label "
     },
     {
      "_key": "1e99c15e5fd3",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong",
       "4a8dabf7ffac"
      ],
      "text": "Agriculture Biologique"
     },
     {
      "_key": "890f0cb2ebca",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " est sans doute le plus connu. Il garantit que la vigne est cultivée "
     },
     {
      "_key": "ba982d41b486",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "sans pesticides ni herbicides chimiques de synthèse"
     },
     {
      "_key": "f14a51a5f8f0",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [
     {
      "_key": "4a8dabf7ffac",
      "_type": "link",
      "href": "https://www.agencebio.org/"
     }
    ],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "d061a1a78d66",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "1fbf87705cba",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Les vignerons bio utilisent principalement :"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "bc2aa5072b92",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "c6b89de9880b",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "des produits naturels"
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "d18fc35fa396",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "5b53f1dbbd27",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "du cuivre et du soufre pour protéger la vigne"
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "affa00843f39",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "4faa10706485",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "des méthodes mécaniques pour gérer les mauvaises herbes"
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "aea2704c6c42",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "aa1f91c839cb",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "En Champagne, la viticulture biologique demande beaucoup d’engagement car le climat est "
     },
     {
      "_key": "9a9c4d75a1eb",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "humide"
     },
     {
      "_key": "68f077e89f37",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": ", ce qui favorise les maladies de la vigne. Mais de plus en plus de domaines franchissent le pas."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "4d593ad4f829",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "393511c603a3",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "La Biodynamie (Demeter / Biodyvin) : l’étape ultime… et un peu folle ! 🌙"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "904d7ab6b125",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "nu3uashxnyui",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "La biodynamie pousse la viticulture "
     },
     {
      "_key": "c9zqd26hbxqa",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "bien au-delà du bio"
     },
     {
      "_key": "dsnuqtfdebsw",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": ", dont elle reprend les règles : aucun produit chimique de synthèse, mais le cuivre et le soufre restent autorisés, en quantités encore plus limitées. Elle renforce la vigne avec des préparations à base de plantes, de bouse ou de compost, en respectant les cycles de la nature. Le calendrier lunaire est souvent suivi, sans être une obligation. L’objectif est de rendre la vigne autonome, vivante et pleinement équilibrée."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "3e31ec9fc6b7",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "d79ef21759cd",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong",
       "30c0ba121f4a"
      ],
      "text": "Biodyvin"
     },
     {
      "_key": "17ed5e0006de",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": " et "
     },
     {
      "_key": "41546fd2c2ab",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong",
       "6a64250916ae"
      ],
      "text": "Demeter"
     },
     {
      "_key": "84838757b7e4",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": " sont deux certifications biodynamiques"
     },
     {
      "_key": "8ed1cjdju9xh",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " peuvent figurer sur les bouteilles. Demeter est une marque internationale, ouverte à toutes les productions agricoles ; Biodyvin est réservé aux vignerons, et l’admission passe aussi par une dégustation des vins. Les deux exigent d’être déjà certifié bio."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [
     {
