    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "38e3e933bc7c",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "dbb5fcea4252",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "Il est important de rappeler qu’un label ne dit pas tout du travail d’un vigneron."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "ec80dcfac967",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "b39b45582f09",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "Certains domaines travaillent de manière très respectueuse de la nature sans forcément demander de certification"
     },
     {
      "_key": "4c506ea44948",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": ", souvent pour des raisons administratives ou financières."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "9fbfce1ab3c4",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "e0413e96c400",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "À l’inverse, un label reste un cadre de référence, mais la philosophie du vigneron et son approche de la vigne restent essentielles."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "795e318cc2f5",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "62a96caa7a07",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Une Champagne de plus en plus engagée"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "cf448a3dadb1",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "d1917121b860",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Ces dernières années, la Champagne s’est fortement engagée dans une transition environnementale."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "6c94f4f7840d",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "d9acbc264022",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "L’objectif de la filière est clair : "
     },
     {
      "_key": "3344b5e619db",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "développer une viticulture toujours plus durable"
     },
     {
      "_key": "f4b36a1c47bc",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": ", capable de préserver les sols, les paysages et la qualité des vins."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "1dfe9f752f42",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "26d0815854d2",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Que ce soit à travers le bio, la HVE ou la viticulture durable, ces labels permettent aux consommateurs de "
     },
     {
      "_key": "7fe3db523eb9",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "mieux comprendre les pratiques des vignerons"
     },
     {
      "_key": "e096252a3be9",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   }
  ]
 },
